        "D2 sample validation: valid samples 7000, 8192, and 16384 MiB, plus a malformed field with numeric prefix 16384.",
        "Execution: two workers, 120-second configuration timeout, and 60-second kill grace.",
        "B7 through B12 have 5, 11, 4, 5, 129, and 6 distinct states in their corrected configurations.",
        "B13 has five distinct states. Abstract cancellation ticks do not establish a wall-clock emergency bound.",
        "B14 has four distinct states. Its atomic admission decision does not model a later crash or a live but stalled guardian.",
        "B15 has six distinct states. Its retained marker does not change during the opening benchmark decision.",
        "B16 has 12 distinct states. Samples are 7000, 8192, and 16384 MiB, with a 4096 MiB floor and band.",
        "B17 has five distinct states. Available space changes from 16384 to 1024 MiB, below the 2048 MiB hard floor.",
        "B18 has fourteen distinct states for guardian death and a disk breach. B19 reuses the four-state GuardianAdmission model and its exact control.",
        "B20 and B21 share the five-state GuardianProgress model and exact control. B22 has six states for fresh, equal-limit, and stale admission ages.",
